{"3786760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Still Space", "steam_appid": 3786760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/8dd40e9e3481040b443d49f88cae37f1.poster.avif?t=1777999429\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/8dd40e9e3481040b443d49f88cae37f1.webm?t=1777999429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/8dd40e9e3481040b443d49f88cae37f1.mp4?t=1777999429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Swarm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in the ruins of a dead world, you fight through endless waves of aliens and rogue machines. Every shot, dodge, and second of hesitation decides your fate. <i>Still Space</i> is a fast and unforgiving 2.5D twin-stick shooter built for players who crave precision under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/d17f512df1458e30a5bba7734bc94c71.poster.avif?t=1777999429\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/d17f512df1458e30a5bba7734bc94c71.webm?t=1777999429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/d17f512df1458e30a5bba7734bc94c71.mp4?t=1777999429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Brutal Dance of Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is quick, loud, and merciless. You move, shoot, and react in tight arenas where death can come from any direction. Each level is a test of control and instinct, designed to keep you in motion and on edge until the very last moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/b3129765f14cdb1fb3b95ba5fd24c978.poster.avif?t=1777999429\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/b3129765f14cdb1fb3b95ba5fd24c978.webm?t=1777999429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/b3129765f14cdb1fb3b95ba5fd24c978.mp4?t=1777999429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Indie Spirit, Hardcore Heart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of <strong>Dead Space</strong>, <strong>Butcher</strong>, <strong>Void Prison</strong>, and <strong>Ultrakill</strong> will feel right at home. <i>Still Space</i> captures the aggression and tension of classic sci-fi horror while delivering the immediacy and flow of modern indie shooters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/b1534040cd42750c9781e32db4dc9e2e.poster.avif?t=1777999429\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/b1534040cd42750c9781e32db4dc9e2e.webm?t=1777999429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/b1534040cd42750c9781e32db4dc9e2e.mp4?t=1777999429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dark beyond the stars, something ancient stirs. The deeper you fight, the closer you come to the thing that watches from the void. You came here to survive, but survival may not be the end.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/8dd40e9e3481040b443d49f88cae37f1.poster.avif?t=1777999429\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/8dd40e9e3481040b443d49f88cae37f1.webm?t=1777999429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/8dd40e9e3481040b443d49f88cae37f1.mp4?t=1777999429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Swarm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in the ruins of a dead world, you fight through endless waves of aliens and rogue machines. Every shot, dodge, and second of hesitation decides your fate. <i>Still Space</i> is a fast and unforgiving 2.5D twin-stick shooter built for players who crave precision under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/d17f512df1458e30a5bba7734bc94c71.poster.avif?t=1777999429\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/d17f512df1458e30a5bba7734bc94c71.webm?t=1777999429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/d17f512df1458e30a5bba7734bc94c71.mp4?t=1777999429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Brutal Dance of Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is quick, loud, and merciless. You move, shoot, and react in tight arenas where death can come from any direction. Each level is a test of control and instinct, designed to keep you in motion and on edge until the very last moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/b3129765f14cdb1fb3b95ba5fd24c978.poster.avif?t=1777999429\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/b3129765f14cdb1fb3b95ba5fd24c978.webm?t=1777999429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/b3129765f14cdb1fb3b95ba5fd24c978.mp4?t=1777999429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Indie Spirit, Hardcore Heart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of <strong>Dead Space</strong>, <strong>Butcher</strong>, <strong>Void Prison</strong>, and <strong>Ultrakill</strong> will feel right at home. <i>Still Space</i> captures the aggression and tension of classic sci-fi horror while delivering the immediacy and flow of modern indie shooters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/b1534040cd42750c9781e32db4dc9e2e.poster.avif?t=1777999429\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/b1534040cd42750c9781e32db4dc9e2e.webm?t=1777999429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786760/extras/b1534040cd42750c9781e32db4dc9e2e.mp4?t=1777999429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the d